--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,14 +1,16 @@
 # Lantern
 
-A tiny static site builder.
+A tiny static site builder with live reload.
 
 ## Install
 
     make install
+    lantern --version
 
 ## Usage
 
 Run `lantern build` in a folder with a `pages/` directory.
-Pages are written to `out/`.
+Pages are written to `site/`.
+Run `lantern serve` to watch and rebuild.
 
 ## License
Only in a: docs/CHANGES.txt
Only in b: docs/history.txt
Binary files a/docs/logo.png and b/docs/logo.png differ
